{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE4L0NvbGV0dGUlMjAlMjgyMDE4JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Colette","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/5fvcs8x7k16wGdet16qkx1cKBPM.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mNiVBMDBaQU2A5XA1KnvmkL6rPI.jpg","description":"After marrying a successful Parisian writer known commonly as Willy, Sidonie-Gabrielle Colette is transplanted from her childhood home in rural France to the intellectual and artistic splendor of Paris. Soon after, Willy convinces Colette to ghostwrite for him. She pens a semi-autobiographical novel about a witty and brazen country girl named Claudine, sparking a bestseller and a cultural sensation. After its success, Colette and Willy become the talk of Paris and their adventures inspire additional Claudine novels.","releaseInfo":"2018","genres":["Drama","History","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.9","runtime":"112 min","cast":["Keira Knightley","Dominic West","Denise Gough","Fiona Shaw","Robert Pugh","Eleanor Tomlinson","Ray Panthaki","Dickie Beau"],"director":["Wash Westmoreland"],"released":"2018-09-21T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"History is about to change","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Keira Knightley","character":"Colette","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bRC1B2VwV0wK3ElciFAK6QZf2wD.jpg"},{"name":"Dominic West","character":"Willy","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6y2M3EWslBPwPlugEFg8XDHfSJ0.jpg"},{"name":"Denise Gough","character":"Missy","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/wWcby4ARYqr8d92ZdjyQcfaiJBW.jpg"},{"name":"Fiona Shaw","character":"Sido","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8X7fZybxtwh2nTvYk6kjRYo9RIY.jpg"},{"name":"Robert Pugh","character":"Jules","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/rHThJc9AxpeoOkPuAHixVfN9AqV.jpg"},{"name":"Eleanor Tomlinson","character":"Georgie Raoul-Duval","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/A2lE5kvZE3tIpKwpAtKbjsMHpf2.jpg"},{"name":"Ray Panthaki","character":"Veber","photo":"https://image